sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Client
    participant F as Security filter chain
    participant J as JWT filter
    participant Ctl as Controller
    participant S as Service
    participant R as Repository
    participant DB as MySQL
    C->>F: Request with Bearer JWT
    F->>J: CORS and CSRF pass
    J->>J: Validate JWT, set SecurityContext
    J->>Ctl: Forward
    Ctl->>Ctl: Role check
    Ctl->>S: Call with caller email
    S->>R: Query scoped to caller company
    R->>DB: SQL
    DB-->>R: Rows
    R-->>S: Entities
    S-->>Ctl: DTOs
    Ctl-->>C: JSON response
